ber":69,"content":"On integrated head e2704f3 (MARATHON-2), verify against the product specification: /app/start.sh stays foreground and serves three HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002 plus Redis on 127.0.0.1:6379; GET /api/health on each node returns 200 {\"status\":\"ok\",\"node_id\":N} with node_id 0/1/2 matching ports (JSON number); SIGKILL of one HTTP node restores that port's health within 60s without stopping the other two; SIGKILL of redis-server leaves health still 200 on all nodes and Redis is respawned by start.sh. No Docker or remote services.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-193220-backend-dev-1--a57b0489/metadata.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":24,"content":"    \"server/health.js\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":27,"content":"    \"test/health.test.js\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-193220-backend-dev-1--a57b0489/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":56,"content":"Title: Bootstrap cluster: start.sh, 3 HTTP nodes, Redis, health","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":64,"content":"Implement /app/start.sh that stays in the foreground, launches Redis on 127.0.0.1:6379, and three HTTP nodes on :8000/:8001/:8002. Auto-respawn killed HTTP nodes within 60s and Redis after kill. GET /api/health on each node returns 200 {status:ok, node_id} with node_id 0/1/2 matching ports. Self-contained; no remote services or Docker-in-Docker.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":69,"content":"MARATHON-2 bootstraps the Huddle cluster runtime at `/app`: a foreground `start.sh` that launches local Redis on `127.0.0.1:6379` and three identical HTTP nodes on `127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002`, keeps them alive under SIGKILL (HTTP respawn ≤60s; Redis respawn after kill), and exposes a stable `GET /api/health` contract returning `{status:\"ok\", node_id}` with `node_id` ∈ `{0,1,2}` matching ports. This is the foundation every later auth, messaging, WS, IRC, and SPA task assumes: process topology, port map, node identity, and local-only Redis.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":101,"content":"| Pub/sub | Redis when healthy; fallback owned by MARATHON-19 (not implemented here) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":107,"content":"### C1 — `GET /api/health` (each HTTP node)","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":111,"content":"| Method / path | `GET /api/health` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":115,"content":"| Success body | `{\"status\":\"ok\",\"node_id\":<number>}` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":117,"content":"| `node_id` | JSON number `0`, `1`, or `2` — **not** a string |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":120,"content":"| Redis dependency | **None.** Health MUST succeed even if Redis is down or restarting (required so MARATHON-19 kill tests do not fail health probes). |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":129,"content":"New design (no needs-revision). Greenfield bootstrap: Node.js stdlib HTTP + bash supervisor + local Redis. Fixed conventions for siblings: NODE_ID/PORT map, /app/data reservation, health independent of Redis. After lead removes architect label, implementer is backend (label already present).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-192850-app-architect-1--8a04d679/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":59,"content":"Title: Bootstrap cluster: start.sh, 3 HTTP nodes, Redis, health","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":67,"content":"Implement /app/start.sh that stays in the foreground, launches Redis on 127.0.0.1:6379, and three HTTP nodes on :8000/:8001/:8002. Auto-respawn killed HTTP nodes within 60s and Redis after kill. GET /api/health on each node returns 200 {status:ok, node_id} with node_id 0/1/2 matching ports. Self-contained; no remote services or Docker-in-Docker.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":29,"totalMatchedLines":29,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":80}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-808ed460-00ba-4214-9db4-ef0bf71f0ae1-10\nfc_38378670-3e56-92f7-8b05-463cb62e88bf_3","startedAtMs":"1787428467305","completedAtMs":"1787428467383"},"model_call_id":"2f17dc1b-eebc-46aa-aac0-1e88652cd6bf-2-0ivs","session_id":"fcce64fe-ab17-4599-a98b-1d1e2b8ee719","timestamp_ms":1787428467411}
